note noopen.om: the seam used while open/ holds no READY file, or salvage/ holds none (the open
note builds shelf uses the salvage slice's form reader). ohroute claims nothing, so /open/ falls
note through to the ordinary 404.
fn ohroute to long
ret 0
end
note ohnav: no entry in the forge row
fn ohnav to void
ret
end
global gobody ulong 3
